rfaces the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task with safe retries and recovery.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gmail_closed_reply_reopen.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gmail_closed_reply_reopen.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/gmail_archive_merge_and_reply_reopen.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-lk.3.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-lk/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-lk.3.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prepare closed-thread replies and resumable activity cursors[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]closed-reply-read[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed-reply-read: add validated reopen config, account-scoped activity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state, closed effective linker selection, paged recent-activity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]discovery, and metadata-first reply preparation. Expose tested typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inputs for the later transaction without enabling incomplete reopening [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in the command. Extend fake gog with separate activity-query responses. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Implement section 1 and its acceptance vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan task reopening, restore, and the exact-message log[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reopen-plan[dim] · [dim][/dim]after closed-reply-read[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reopen-plan: implement the pure local reopen planner over staged vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshots. Share the task-restore row helper, select the newest